WEBVTT

00:02.981 --> 00:04.980
Priestesses of the Godless Month

00:02.981 --> 00:04.980
Kannazuki no Miko

00:08.000 --> 00:10.830
The brave and mighty Susanou no Mikoto.

00:12.000 --> 00:15.030
The country of Izumo falls
on the river of sunlight.

00:16.210 --> 00:17.990
Eight-headed dragon of the land...

00:18.710 --> 00:21.500
diminish at the blade
of the Totsuka Sword.

00:26.790 --> 00:29.750
God of Takemi Katana.
God of Iwatsutsu no O.

00:30.490 --> 00:33.760
God of Kanayama Hiko. God of Kanayama Hime.

00:34.390 --> 00:35.760
God of Tsurugi no Ikusa.

00:52.410 --> 00:53.480
Ow...

00:57.620 --> 00:59.149
My...

00:59.150 --> 01:01.380
My very own ritual.

01:02.450 --> 01:05.040
I don't know if I can do it.

01:05.080 --> 01:06.250
But...

01:06.660 --> 01:08.290
But still, I...

01:37.830 --> 01:41.895
haruka ni sotto yurameku urei
kattou no kioku ni ugokasare

01:41.896 --> 01:45.959
Moving the slowly unfolding, distressing
troubles from afar that were in the past

01:45.960 --> 01:49.025
mabuta ni zutto haritsuku
shiroi zekkyou ni kogoeta

01:49.026 --> 01:52.089
Strongly closing the eyelids,
the white screams have frozen

01:52.090 --> 01:54.220
- shizumu tsuki no mayoi
- The confusion of the setting moon

01:54.850 --> 01:56.620
Sonzai wa tashikani Ima koko ni

01:56.621 --> 01:58.389
Surely my existence is here now

01:58.390 --> 02:00.100
- matte iru no wa
- Waiting for me

02:00.103 --> 02:01.435
Namida nado mou nagasanai

02:01.436 --> 02:02.769
There's no more tears to cry

02:02.770 --> 02:04.895
tada dakiaeru shunkan

02:04.896 --> 02:07.020
When the moment comes when
we embrace each other

02:07.480 --> 02:09.630
ienai kikenai mienai maboroshi dake

02:09.631 --> 02:11.780
Unspoken, unheard, unseen, just an illusion

02:11.990 --> 02:14.430
toki no mukou kawa e to nagasarete

02:14.431 --> 02:16.869
Flowing towards the other side of time,

02:16.870 --> 02:19.205
mayoigo ni naru yurusenu negai

02:19.206 --> 02:21.540
becoming like a lost
child, an unforgiven wish

02:21.830 --> 02:24.020
koe dake yubi dake chikazuku ondo dake

02:24.021 --> 02:26.209
Only voice, only fingers,
only the approaching warmth

02:26.210 --> 02:30.505
todokanu omoi ga chigirarete
yokaze o someru

02:30.506 --> 02:34.800
Unspoken thoughts get tainted
by the shredded night wind

02:44.380 --> 02:47.100
God of Takemi Katana.
God of Iwatsutsu no O.

02:47.860 --> 02:50.810
God of Kanayama Hiko. God of Kanayama Hime.

02:51.560 --> 02:55.160
God of Tsurugi no Ikusa.
God of Tate no Ikusa.

03:13.280 --> 03:15.210
I'm sorry, Kurusugawa-kun.

03:16.860 --> 03:17.959
Endure.

03:17.960 --> 03:20.450
Tenth Episode

03:20.451 --> 03:22.940
Invitation of Love and Death

03:29.000 --> 03:31.730
The only thing I can do.

03:38.040 --> 03:38.980
Not yet.

03:38.981 --> 03:40.530
Not yet. That's it for today.

03:43.750 --> 03:45.949
But I can still...

03:45.950 --> 03:49.279
The ritual requires focus and energy.

03:49.280 --> 03:54.380
It's frustrating, but going further
will only damage your body.

03:56.090 --> 03:57.160
Right.

04:03.670 --> 04:05.140
Kazuki-niisan.

04:18.950 --> 04:21.650
She always understood me.

04:22.320 --> 04:27.760
Chikane-chan taught me all sorts of things
and always protected me.

04:28.830 --> 04:33.660
I grew to like photography
more because she praised me.

04:33.940 --> 04:37.160
I went on a date because she supported me.

04:38.070 --> 04:42.550
I felt I could do my best as Solar
Priestess because she was with me.

04:43.040 --> 04:44.550
Angelic Chikane-chan.

04:45.440 --> 04:46.720
But...

04:46.800 --> 04:51.600
But that night, she really scared
me and looked like a devil.

04:54.290 --> 04:57.119
An angel... A devil...

04:57.120 --> 04:58.950
Which is the real...

05:10.070 --> 05:11.290
Chikane-chan.

05:27.750 --> 05:30.180
I need to confirm...

05:33.140 --> 05:35.120
the truth about Chikane-chan.

05:40.430 --> 05:42.760
Here I go, Chikane-chan.

05:49.340 --> 05:53.080
The brave and mighty Susanou no Mikoto.

05:57.850 --> 06:00.590
Orochi is darkness.

06:12.300 --> 06:14.310
Abandoned by God.

06:18.090 --> 06:20.500
Torn by war.

06:23.910 --> 06:26.280
Betrayed by dreams.

06:30.650 --> 06:33.620
Hurt by success.

06:35.620 --> 06:37.790
Not knowing sympathy.

06:55.170 --> 06:58.599
God of Takemi Katana.
God of Iwatsutsu no O.

06:58.600 --> 07:01.779
God of Kanayama Hiko. God of Kanayama Hime.

07:01.780 --> 07:04.110
God of Tsurugi no Ikusa.
God of Tate no Ikusa.

07:21.430 --> 07:22.590
Chikane-chan.

07:23.570 --> 07:26.469
Along with the powers of
the eight million gods.

07:26.470 --> 07:30.370
I wish for the revival of Ame no Murakumo.

07:35.100 --> 07:40.180
Release the God of Susanou. The
atoning life shall be driven out.

07:41.850 --> 07:42.850
Shinchoku.

08:38.380 --> 08:39.270
This...

08:39.271 --> 08:41.500
It's your sword, the Solar Priestess Blade.

08:41.900 --> 08:43.879
Solar Priestess Blade?

08:43.880 --> 08:47.449
The swordsman Ame no Murakumo has revived.

08:47.450 --> 08:48.710
This is proof.

08:49.190 --> 08:51.210
Revived?

08:51.530 --> 08:54.259
Yes, you revived him.

08:54.260 --> 08:56.930
Your determination and courage.

08:57.300 --> 08:58.730
Me?

08:59.760 --> 09:03.890
I did it. I was able to
do it too, Chikane-chan.

09:12.340 --> 09:13.360
Kurusugawa-kun!

09:26.220 --> 09:30.559
How could a girl like you
hurt yourself like this?

09:30.560 --> 09:31.710
Sorry.

09:35.720 --> 09:37.720
Oogami-kun?

09:37.950 --> 09:40.850
I want to talk to you alone.

09:45.280 --> 09:46.850
Is the wound better?

09:47.950 --> 09:51.019
It still hurts a bit, but I'll be fine.

09:51.020 --> 09:52.820
You're so strong.

09:53.500 --> 09:57.320
I thought somewhere in my
mind that you couldn't fight.

09:57.760 --> 10:01.090
That's why I thought I had to protect you.

10:01.730 --> 10:03.910
But I was wrong.

10:04.260 --> 10:06.059
With this tough job...

10:06.060 --> 10:10.260
you thought alone, acted
alone, and fought alone.

10:10.940 --> 10:12.170
You're truly amazing.

10:13.640 --> 10:18.070
You gave me the power and
determination to fight.

10:18.540 --> 10:21.349
Not knowing that, I was arrogant.

10:21.350 --> 10:23.280
That's not true.

10:24.350 --> 10:28.640
During the ritual, I was in
pain, frustrated, scared...

10:29.020 --> 10:31.659
and thought of giving up many times.

10:31.660 --> 10:34.900
If I were alone, I'm sure
I couldn't do my best.

10:35.430 --> 10:38.150
I also receive power from others.

10:38.730 --> 10:40.299
I see.

10:40.300 --> 10:41.660
That might be true.

10:42.230 --> 10:44.939
Everyone receives power from others.

10:44.940 --> 10:47.160
I'm sure everyone's like that.

10:47.470 --> 10:49.039
You're right.

10:49.040 --> 10:52.170
Himeko, I want to board Ame no Murakumo.

10:53.210 --> 10:55.369
I'll board Ame no Murakumo.

10:55.370 --> 10:58.170
I'll fight Orochi and Himemiya.

10:58.720 --> 11:00.719
Fight Chikane-chan?

11:00.720 --> 11:03.689
I... I can't do that.

11:03.690 --> 11:05.959
You can't? Why?

11:05.960 --> 11:07.530
Himemiya's already...

11:08.630 --> 11:09.690
Sorry.

11:11.460 --> 11:14.730
I'm sure what I'm saying is strange.

11:15.630 --> 11:19.969
But it's not that I want to fight.

11:19.970 --> 11:23.809
I want to see her. I
want to know the truth.

11:23.810 --> 11:26.200
Chikane-chan's true reason.

11:27.650 --> 11:30.579
That's all I can think about now.

11:30.580 --> 11:32.790
Then that's fine with me.

11:33.180 --> 11:36.619
Decide what to do after meeting Himemiya.

11:36.620 --> 11:39.300
But that will put you in...

11:40.290 --> 11:43.059
You'll board Ame no Murakumo?

11:43.060 --> 11:45.329
I know it's reckless.

11:45.330 --> 11:48.470
But that's all I can do now.

11:48.930 --> 11:50.839
It won't be just me.

11:50.840 --> 11:53.339
Tsubasa-niisan will also lend a hand.

11:53.340 --> 11:55.040
With the two of us...

11:57.140 --> 11:59.190
Please answer, Kazuki-niisan.

12:03.110 --> 12:04.370
I'll be fine.

12:05.550 --> 12:09.189
Nothing that'd worry you will happen.

12:09.190 --> 12:10.959
Kazuki-niisan guarantees it.

12:10.960 --> 12:13.960
It... It really is okay?

12:14.330 --> 12:15.859
Yeah, really.

12:15.860 --> 12:16.860
Souma-kun.

12:18.160 --> 12:21.720
To be honest, I need to tell you something.

12:23.100 --> 12:25.099
But not right now.

12:25.100 --> 12:29.270
When the battle's over, and
everything's settled, I'll tell you.

12:29.510 --> 12:31.539
It can't be now?

12:31.540 --> 12:32.709
Yeah.

12:32.710 --> 12:34.270
Is that bad?

12:35.580 --> 12:37.519
It's fine. I'll wait.

12:37.520 --> 12:38.980
Good, I'm glad.

12:39.880 --> 12:44.580
From today, I'm your sword,
your shield, and your fist.

12:44.960 --> 12:47.030
So I'll never lose again.

12:48.430 --> 12:49.540
Souma-kun.

12:50.530 --> 12:51.720
Never.

12:58.040 --> 13:01.270
Himeko, this time for sure...

13:08.380 --> 13:09.879
It's really okay?

13:09.880 --> 13:13.419
Yes, you should stay over.

13:13.420 --> 13:17.889
You're hurt, and I feel
you'll be safer here.

13:17.890 --> 13:19.359
I'm sorry.

13:19.360 --> 13:23.360
But I have things I want
to do once I get back.

13:48.150 --> 13:49.970
Welcome back, Himeko.

13:50.490 --> 13:52.970
I-I'm home.

14:09.370 --> 14:11.460
Chi... Chikane-chan.

14:14.280 --> 14:15.500
What's wrong with your hand?

14:16.050 --> 14:17.460
Um...

14:19.120 --> 14:20.610
Let me take a look.

14:21.420 --> 14:24.000
Oh, in the revival ritual.

14:27.040 --> 14:28.850
There, that's done.

14:34.300 --> 14:35.650
Is something wrong?

14:35.900 --> 14:37.270
Um, uh...

14:37.700 --> 14:38.770
What?

14:39.880 --> 14:41.770
It's nothing.

14:42.910 --> 14:43.910
I see.

14:47.490 --> 14:51.370
It was a dreamlike time.

14:57.880 --> 15:01.800
The ordinary times that suddenly
shattered on that night.

15:04.430 --> 15:06.690
I was just surprised and confused...

15:07.320 --> 15:15.320
by how suddenly those lost
days returned without any notice.

15:18.340 --> 15:23.730
No, actually, I may have just
wanted to remain confused.

15:24.250 --> 15:29.569
Simply chatting with Chikane-chan,
eating dinner, and laughing...

15:29.570 --> 15:33.489
I was truly happy to spend
ordinary times with her...

15:33.490 --> 15:35.580
and it seemed like a lovely spell.

15:36.560 --> 15:42.080
I knew there were things I wanted
to ask, things I needed to ask.

15:46.240 --> 15:48.460
But if I asked those questions...

15:48.910 --> 15:51.090
it seemed as if the spell would go away.

15:53.710 --> 15:58.110
I was just afraid that the
dreamlike times would end.

16:02.220 --> 16:04.620
Is this time a dream...

16:05.990 --> 16:08.280
or was that night a dream?

16:08.660 --> 16:10.990
Which one is my truth?

16:11.760 --> 16:12.990
I...

16:35.620 --> 16:38.100
You cleaned my room for me?

16:39.090 --> 16:43.600
The entire mansion was futile, but
I thought at least your room...

16:44.800 --> 16:47.630
So that you could return anytime.

16:48.430 --> 16:51.569
B-But I didn't look through your drawers.

16:51.570 --> 16:52.860
Honestly.

16:53.160 --> 16:55.909
You needn't worry about such things.

16:55.910 --> 16:56.970
What?

17:00.950 --> 17:02.870
The bed is so soft.

17:05.080 --> 17:07.179
Soft and warm.

17:07.180 --> 17:10.380
The sun's smell that gently envelops me.

17:10.640 --> 17:13.590
Your lovely scent.

17:36.930 --> 17:37.930
Come in.

17:42.490 --> 17:44.580
What's wrong, Himeko?

17:44.900 --> 17:45.900
Um...

17:46.320 --> 17:47.759
Um...

17:47.760 --> 17:50.590
Can I sleep with you tonight?

17:52.840 --> 17:55.090
Um, can't I?

17:57.270 --> 17:58.270
Sure.

18:16.560 --> 18:19.280
Is your hand okay? Does it hurt?

18:19.520 --> 18:23.160
It hurts a bit, but I'm okay.

18:23.890 --> 18:26.750
Is it my fault? I hurt it.

18:29.550 --> 18:31.469
It's okay, Chikane-chan.

18:31.470 --> 18:33.769
This is really nothing.

18:33.770 --> 18:39.510
The hurt and pain don't bother
me because you came back.

18:41.750 --> 18:42.949
I'm...

18:42.950 --> 18:46.419
That by itself for me...

18:46.420 --> 18:47.100
For me...

18:47.290 --> 18:48.489
Himeko.

18:48.490 --> 18:49.880
Chikane-chan!

18:50.350 --> 18:53.980
You did your best. I'm
really impressed, Himeko.

18:58.830 --> 19:01.690
Chikane-chan was very warm...

19:03.730 --> 19:09.500
and she held me more securely
than anything in this world.

19:22.520 --> 19:23.520
Chikane-chan?

19:26.820 --> 19:28.050
Chikane-chan?

19:28.460 --> 19:31.030
Where'd you go, Chikane-chan?

19:32.520 --> 19:34.899
It... It can't be.

19:34.900 --> 19:38.030
A dream again... It can't be, Chikane-chan!

19:38.260 --> 19:39.260
Chikane-chan!

19:40.570 --> 19:41.570
Where?

19:42.410 --> 19:43.820
Answer me, Chikane-chan!

19:44.340 --> 19:46.330
Chikane-chan!

19:57.290 --> 19:58.510
Himeko?

20:03.660 --> 20:07.059
I was getting breakfast
ingredients in the garden.

20:07.060 --> 20:08.100
Did something happen?

20:12.100 --> 20:14.339
Look, I picked good ones.

20:14.340 --> 20:15.360
Chikane-chan!

20:15.520 --> 20:16.520
Himeko?

20:16.940 --> 20:20.470
Chikane-chan! Chikane-chan! Chikane-chan!

20:22.600 --> 20:25.450
It's not a dream, right? It's you, right?

20:25.700 --> 20:27.419
You can hear me, right?

20:27.420 --> 20:28.879
Touch me, right?

20:28.880 --> 20:30.789
Feel me, right?

20:30.790 --> 20:33.370
I'm right in front of you.

20:33.690 --> 20:37.840
I was afraid that you went away again.

20:38.140 --> 20:40.380
That you left without a word.

20:40.900 --> 20:43.090
Were you lonely without me?

20:44.620 --> 20:46.550
Were you happy that I came back?

20:49.370 --> 20:53.620
Will you still love me?

20:55.650 --> 20:56.650
I love you.

20:57.550 --> 20:58.550
I see.

21:03.550 --> 21:07.450
Himeko, a black moon will
rise in the sky tonight.

21:07.930 --> 21:10.450
A dark moon that will devour the world.

21:12.030 --> 21:13.260
Himeko.

21:27.950 --> 21:31.060
At that time, I will kill you.

21:34.950 --> 21:38.060
A party just for us. Make
sure to come this time.

21:39.860 --> 21:41.360
Good day, Himeko.

22:03.080 --> 22:04.480
Chikane-chan...

22:10.100 --> 22:11.780
- Itsuka mita yume
- A dream that was once saw

22:11.783 --> 22:13.790
- Todokanai tsubuyaki dake
- Just a murmur that does not get through

22:13.793 --> 22:15.595
Yoru no hikari ni tsutsumarete samayoi yuku

22:15.596 --> 22:17.399
Wandering while wrapped up in night's light

22:17.400 --> 22:20.980
- Yagate mihiraku sono hitomi Unmei nara - If it
is fate, those eyes will be opened before long

22:20.983 --> 22:22.505
Semete Sou ima dake

22:22.506 --> 22:24.029
At least... yes, only now

22:24.030 --> 22:26.390
- Kanawanai to utsumuku - Looking
downward as the wish does not come true

22:26.393 --> 22:28.390
- Yokaze ni tada unadare
- Merely hanging my head in the night wind

22:28.393 --> 22:32.080
- Namida Tsukikage Te no hira ni afurete yuku - Tears
and moonlight continue to overflow from my palm

22:32.083 --> 22:33.650
- Nani ga hoshii no
- What do you want?

22:33.653 --> 22:35.870
Kuchibiru wa yami ni furuete ita

22:35.871 --> 22:38.089
My lips shivered in the darkness

22:38.090 --> 22:40.430
Deatta ano toki ni mune tsuita egao

22:40.431 --> 22:42.769
The smiling face that pierced
my chest when we came across

22:42.770 --> 22:45.710
Mamoritakute Zutto kuzuresou na yakusoku o

22:45.711 --> 22:48.649
I want to protect it, the promise
that always looks about to collapse

22:48.650 --> 22:50.685
Itami tsubusu hodo ni dakishimeteta

22:50.686 --> 22:52.720
I embraced it while crushing the pain

22:53.560 --> 22:54.975
Soba ni ireru dake de

22:54.976 --> 22:56.389
Just by being by my side

22:56.390 --> 22:58.200
Onaji jikan ni irareru dake de

22:58.201 --> 23:00.009
Just by remaining in the same time as me

23:00.010 --> 23:03.480
Tooi kioku Yomigaeru kanashimi
mo atatamete yukeru no ni

23:03.481 --> 23:06.949
The distant memory and
revived sadness can warmed

23:06.950 --> 23:08.930
Mawaritsuzukete iru omoi ni

23:08.931 --> 23:10.909
In the feelings that continue to circulate

23:10.910 --> 23:12.725
Yasuragi michita owari wa kuru no

23:12.726 --> 23:14.539
Will a peaceful ending come?

23:14.540 --> 23:16.360
Kurikaeshita toikake wa ten ni mai

23:16.361 --> 23:18.179
The repeated question dance in heavens

23:18.180 --> 23:23.705
Ake no sora no Hikari ni kawaru

23:23.706 --> 23:29.230
And turns into the light of the morning sky

23:40.040 --> 23:42.010
Next Time

23:42.480 --> 23:47.310
A dark moon rises in the sky, and
the last battle's curtain rises.

23:47.820 --> 23:51.360
Since I want the truth, since
I want to confirm it again...

23:51.620 --> 23:54.260
we fight violently with our swords.

23:54.730 --> 23:58.949
While staining the world
red with blood and fire.

23:58.950 --> 24:05.960
Dance of Swords

23:59.860 --> 24:03.229
Next time on Kannazuki
no Miko, episode 11...

24:03.230 --> 24:04.800
Dance of Swords.

24:05.340 --> 24:08.800
Chikane-chan, what am I supposed to do?
